      "releaseNotes": "HRV4Training: a complete app redesign, with improved usability and new features. This update also fixes reading data from Oura, a crash when syncing with Strava, Oura, Coros or TrainingPeaks, adds a Cancel button while looking for your Bluetooth sensor, and includes other bug fixes. More on our Substack: https://marcoaltini.substack.com\n\nNew: a morning reminder to measure (Menu > Settings).\n\nFixed: saving your data export to Files or sending it by email.\n\nFixed: sending rMSSD to TrainingPeaks for Pro users.\n\nIf you find the app useful, please take a few minutes to review it. It makes a difference. Thank you!\n\nFor any issues, write to hello@HRV4Training.com and we'll do our best to help.\n\nCheers, Marco & Ale",
      "releaseDate": "2013-08-14T18:45:43Z",
